# Realms and portals (docs/VISION.md §4, §7.1), proved through real input:
# a shaft found on the surface, walked to, gone down, stood in, and come back up.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/realms.tour --seed=1 --hour=10
#
# Nothing here teleports across a realm. `place shaft` is staging — a shaft is a
# place in the world (WorldData.landmarks), so the tour asks the world where one
# is instead of copying a tile off a map run — and every step after it is a real
# walk or a real key. Which landscape a shaft comes up in is a fact about one
# seed, so the frames above ground declare the REALM they are in and not the
# ground they happen to stand on.

hour 10
place shaft
# Away from the mouth first, so what follows is a walk TO it and not off it.
walk 1,1 0.9
wait 0.4
shot 01-above-ground with realm:surface

# Back to it on foot, until it is in reach and the slate says so. Steered to
# the shaft by name, on the real move keys: a timed walk back ended wherever the
# props on the way let it, and once the scatter laid new ones (GEN 23) that was
# outside the reach on every build.
walkto shaft 6
await portal 15
shot 02-a-shaft-in-the-rock with realm:surface,portal

# Down. The world under the world is raised on one worker from the game's third
# frame (20_realms WARM_AFTER), and `place` above stood us at the shaft long
# before a walk would have: the page covers the rest of the raise. An 1840
# underground on one worker is 73 s at load 15-18 and 95 s at load 22 (measured
# 2026-09-26, after its one-landscape tiles stage stopped costing 15 s of it),
# so the wait is the raise's, not a stall's.
press use
await realm:underground 150
await crossed 5
await land:limestone_caves 10
wait 1.2
shot 03-limestone-caves-hall with land:limestone_caves

# Standing in it: the lamp is the only warm thing down here, and the page it is
# lit against is the scratchboard (VISION §8).
press lamp
await lamp 5
wait 0.8
shot 04-the-hall-by-lamp with land:limestone_caves,lamp

# A walk away from the mouth, so the frame is the landscape and not the gate.
walk 1,0 1.8
wait 0.6
shot 05-along-the-gallery with land:limestone_caves

# And back up the same shaft, by the same key.
place shaft
wait 0.6
await portal 15
shot 06-the-shaft-head-below with land:limestone_caves,portal
press use
await realm:surface 40
await land:surface 10
wait 1.2
shot 07-back-above-ground with realm:surface

# The score crossed two realms and never fell silent (75_music GAP_BUDGET).
await score_unbroken 60
